  },
  "speed_multipliers": {"default": 1, "priority": 2.5},
  "models": {
    "gpt-6.1-sol": {"input_credits": 50, "cached_credits": 2.5, "output_credits": 250},
    "gpt-6-astra": {"input_credits": 250, "cached_credits": 25, "output_credits": 1250},
    "gpt-6.1-terra": {"input_credits": 25, "cached_credits": 1.25, "output_credits": 125},
    "gpt-6-sol": {"input_credits": 50, "cached_credits": 5, "output_credits": 250},
    "gpt-6-luna": {"input_credits": 2.5, "cached_credits": 0.25, "output_credits": 12.5}
  },
  "note": "按订阅 Standard 1×、Fast 2.5× 计算美元等值，展示均值；按已核验的 Standard token 价格权重归一化（credits ÷ 25），用于比较，不代表实际现金扣费、套餐扣减或余额百分比。包含主代理及全部子代理。Codex 无独立缓存写入费，Sol 订阅用量无长上下文附加费；历史 API 数据保留。"
}
